or state styling"],[190,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1302,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[945,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[1131,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[591,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1240,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1335,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[506,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1297,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[619,"**Menu Items:** `data-hovered`, `data-focused`, `data-pressed`, `data-selected`, `data-disabled`"],[523,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1301,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1134,"**Multiline**: Set `multiline` to render a textarea instead of a single-line input"],[517,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[882,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[438,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[718,"**Page Up** / **Page Down**: larger increase or decrease when supported"],[504,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[620,"**Popover:** `data-entering`, `data-exiting`"],[521,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[514,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[814,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[813,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[593,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[950,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[1136,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria TextField for accessibility and behavior"],[1503,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[505,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[500,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[1276,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1308,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1242,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1281,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1306,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1303,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[917,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[918,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[969,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[198,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1337,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1274,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[946,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[589,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[1219,"**Space / Enter**"],[819,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[197,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[622,"**Space/Enter**: Opens menu and activates items"],[921,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[499,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[509,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[975,"**Standalone** — with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[1311,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1300,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[449,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[493,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1215,"**Tab**"],[628,"**Tab**: Closes menu and moves to next element"],[196,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[816,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[919,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[884,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1211,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1210,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1315,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1304,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[508,"**Trade-offs:**"],[450,"**Transform